{"date":"1943-06-26","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/ff/14/132368_3fLZz.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/ff/14/132368_3fLZz.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/ff/14/132368_3fLZz.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/ff/14/132368_3fLZz.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/ff/14/132368_3fLZz.jpg"},"summary":"　　这一天，汤姆和杰瑞之间爆发了一场声势浩大的大战。汤姆一路追逐，将小老鼠赶进了地下室的洞中。杰瑞躲在掩体后，自然不会放过死守洞口的敌人，于是用老鼠夹子发射了一枚西红柿，跟着又爬上制高点丢下一大鸡蛋。汤姆被突然到来的袭击打得措手不及，他四处逃窜，慌不择路。而杰瑞愈战愈勇，将香槟一字排开，酒瓶塞如炮弹一般呼啸着射向汤姆的脑袋。汤姆当然不会就此认输，他再次杀向前去，而他的对手如此聪明，早已想好各种妙招对付他。杰瑞甚至还用芝士锉（cheese grater）做了一辆战车打出漂亮的防守反击。他们的战斗逐渐升级…… \r\n　　本片荣获1943年奥斯卡金像奖最佳动画短片奖，也是Tom and Jerry系列获得的第一个奖项。","name":"The Yankee Doodle Mouse","name_cn":"扬基都德鼠","tags":[{"name":"短片","count":53,"total_count":102560},{"name":"欧美","count":30,"total_count":86977},{"name":"猫和老鼠","count":29,"total_count":1649},{"name":"1943","count":19,"total_count":224},{"name":"奥斯卡","count":16,"total_count":1864},{"name":"米高梅","count":13,"total_count":442},{"name":"美国","count":10,"total_count":27212},{"name":"搞笑","count":9,"total_count":640727},{"name":"童年","count":8,"total_count":93245},{"name":"1940s","count":7,"total_count":285},{"name":"剧场版","count":4,"total_count":726360},{"name":"Boom!","count":4,"total_count":4},{"name":"原创","count":3,"total_count":622139},{"name":"MGM","count":3,"total_count":62},{"name":"智商碾压","count":2,"total_count":6},{"name":"欢乐","count":2,"total_count":6486},{"name":"动画短片","count":2,"total_count":2076},{"name":"1940-1949","count":2,"total_count":135},{"name":"Short","count":2,"total_count":1547},{"name":"经典","count":1,"total_count":23164},{"name":"短片&OVA","count":1,"total_count":138},{"name":"Hanna","count":1,"total_count":10},{"name":"动画","count":1,"total_count":35757},{"name":"40s","count":1,"total_count":59},{"name":"先驱","count":1,"total_count":115},{"name":"60年代前","count":1,"total_count":163},{"name":"子供向","count":1,"total_count":13019},{"name":"Oscars